{"id":"44daac0977222042","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-cut-free-proof.md","title":"Cut Free Proof","display":"df-cut-free-proof — Cut Free Proof","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-cut-free-proof","aliases":["72-df-cut-free-proof"],"display":"df-cut-free-proof — Cut Free Proof","depends_on":["[[72-df-proof-tree]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §1.2.2 print12/PDF24","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_2026_10_22":"把CutFree谓词的投影调用限制在合法证明域内"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-cut-free-proof"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-cut-free-proof</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cut-free-proof — Cut Free Proof"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §1.2.2 print12/PDF24"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"把CutFree谓词的投影调用限制在合法证明域内"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\\)</span> 是带标签演算，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{cut}\">\\(\\mathsf{cut}\\)</span> 专用于切规则；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tag}_\\pi\">\\(\\operatorname{Tag}_\\pi\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CutFree}_\\mathcal C(\\pi):\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\pi\\in\\{\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C:\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Nodes}(\\rho)\\ (\\operatorname{Tag}_\\rho(u)\\ne\\mathsf{cut})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CutFree}_\\mathcal C(\\pi):\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\pi\\in\\{\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C:\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Nodes}(\\rho)\\ (\\operatorname{Tag}_\\rho(u)\\ne\\mathsf{cut})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是有限证明上的谓词；无穷证明若需同名性质必须明确更换证明域。相同结论不决定是否使用Cut。</p>\n<p>2026-10-22：先在合法Proof集合内分离无cut证明，再定义成员谓词。这样对任意输入π都有真值，且不会在非法输入上调用只为证明对象定义的Nodes或Tag投影。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle$ 是带标签演算，$\\mathsf{cut}$ 专用于切规则；$\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C$ 与 $\\operatorname{Tag}_\\pi$ 见 [[72-df-proof-tree]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{cut}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Tag}_\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CutFree}_\\mathcal C(\\pi):\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\pi\\in\\{\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C:\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Nodes}(\\rho)\\ (\\operatorname{Tag}_\\rho(u)\\ne\\mathsf{cut})\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1358,"backlinks":[{"id":"715dbcdaf4fc3a32","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-132","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-cut-free-proof|df-cut-free-proof — Cut Free Proof]]"},{"id":"26a82e49d1c1995d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["81c9c855e009a6d4"]}